Krita Nova 52 - the Layers docker's "+" opens the layer menu

The "+" (Add) button of the Layers docker was a split button: a click added a
paint layer, its small arrow opened the menu of layer and mask types. Now
there is no arrow part: a click on "+" opens that menu (paint, group, clone,
vector, fill, file layer, the masks ...). The keyboard shortcut (Insert, "Add
Paint Layer") is unchanged; the tooltip says so: "Add new layer or mask
(paint layer: Insert)".

LayerBox.cpp: the menu is set on bnAdd only while it is open (no split part,
no menu indicator): pressed() sets it and calls showMenu(), like QToolButton
opens its menus - on the press; a popup opened on the release (clicked())
was closed again at once on Android.
